  "ingredients": [
    "2 pounds ground beef",
    "1 cup dry bread crumbs",
    "0.5 cup diced onion",
    "0.5 apple - peeled, cored, and diced",
    "1 egg",
    "2 teaspoons garlic powder",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "0.5 teaspoon ground black pepper",
    "0.33333334326744 cup ketchup",
    "2 tablespoons prepared yellow mustard",
    "2 tablespoons brown sugar"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Make the meatloaf: Mix beef, bread crumbs, onion, apple, egg, garlic powder, salt, and pepper in a large bowl until evenly blended.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/46UyHpwLefe-jPh8oU98S1wz6MM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/265169_InstantPotMeatloaf_ddmfs_Step1_3x4_3287-ecbb32befc8d4cb1bc59c7b6c782b186.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/265169/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Shape the beef mixture into a loaf and place on a large piece of aluminum foil. Fold the foil up and around the edges of the meatloaf, creating a makeshift loaf pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/hdOdYJCnd02AC-MaB5qx3YdbJgw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/265169_InstantPotMeatloaf_ddmfs_Step2_3x4_3291-f329f07c48c642019f75bc16952bbf3b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/265169/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour 1/2 cup water into a multi-functional pressure cooker (such as Instant Pot) and place the steam rack inside with the handles up. Place the meatloaf on top of the rack. Close and lock the lid; seal the vent. Select high pressure according to manufacturer’s instructions; set timer for 25 minutes. Allow 10 to 15 minutes for pressure to build.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Gu6mD5iYXs70KzkkvdJWc_cVYks=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/265169_InstantPotMeatloaf_ddmfs_Step3_3x4_3293-5e139aef0cea486abcdf0e53f5e185fc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/265169/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Set an oven rack about 6 inches from the heat source and preheat the oven’s broiler.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Release cooker pressure carefully using the quick-release method according to the manufacturer’s instructions, about 5 minutes. Unlock and remove the lid. Transfer meatloaf, still on the rack, to a baking sheet. Broil meatloaf in the oven until browned, about 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/tgqpSi26R0cf9pySykVZJ2dMhIM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/265169_InstantPotMeatloaf_ddmfs_Step4_3x4_3338-662079986b934e74abfe7803309b23ae.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/265169/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, make the topping: Combine ketchup, mustard, and brown sugar in a small bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8N3Z9FYL2uCXRtpYxuT8qYkec8Y=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/265169_InstantPotMeatloaf_ddmfs_Step5_3x4_3345-8d9037d104ce43ef93c15600b837d6c9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/265169/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Brush over meatloaf and broil again until caramelized, 1 to 2 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8K15ihnPnDrt0eI0f7EDBBhXCPA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/265169_InstantPotMeatloaf_ddmfs_3x4_3376-5c4cb45e46684783b17ea9351c71a20d.jpg"
      ],
